{"title":"Career Roadmap · Film Festival Coordinator","role":"Film Festival Coordinator","summary":"A Film Festival Coordinator manages the planning, programming support, logistics, communication and execution of film festivals, screenings, filmmaker interactions and related cultural events.","facts":{"Current degree":"BJMC / B.A. Journalism & Mass Communication","Course":"Film Studies / Cinema Journalism"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Film Festival Coordinator manages the planning, programming support, logistics, communication and execution of film festivals, screenings, filmmaker interactions and related cultural events."},{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines film knowledge","event management","media communication","stakeholder coordination","digital marketing."],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"A coordinator may work with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Film festivals"},{"text":"Film societies"},{"text":"Cultural institutions"},{"text":"Universities and colleges"},{"text":"Production houses"},{"text":"OTT/media organizations"},{"text":"Government cultural bodies"},{"text":"NGOs and arts organizations"},{"text":"International film organizations"},{"text":"Independent cinema networks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Typical Responsibilities"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Festival planning"},{"text":"Film submission coordination"},{"text":"Entry/document management"},{"text":"Filmmaker communication"},{"text":"Screening scheduling"},{"text":"Venue coordination"},{"text":"Jury coordination"},{"text":"Guest management"},{"text":"Press and media coordination"},{"text":"Social-media promotion"},{"text":"Volunteer management"},{"text":"Accreditation"},{"text":"Audience engagement"},{"text":"Awards/event logistics"},{"text":"Post-festival reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The role is particularly suitable for someone interested in cinema, journalism, cultural events and media